        mbaleath@uccs.edu
      </span>
      <span>
        <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M22 16.92v3a2 2 0 01-2.18 2 19.79 19.79 0 01-8.63-3.07A19.5 19.5 0 013.07 9.81 19.79 19.79 0 01.18 3.17 2 2 0 012.16 1h3a2 2 0 012 1.72 12.84 12.84 0 00.7 2.81 2 2 0 01-.45 2.11L6.09 8.91a16 16 0 006 6l1.27-1.27a2 2 0 012.11-.45 12.84 12.84 0 002.81.7A2 2 0 0122 16.92z"/></svg>
        719.354.8477
      </span>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-stats">
      <div class="stat"><div class="stat-num">3+</div><div class="stat-label">Years Experience</div></div>
